    "final_answer": "I have found the perfect recipe. Here is the answer to the task:\n\n## 🍕 Cauliflower Pizza Crust Recipe Found on Allrecipes\n\n**Recipe:** [Cauliflower Pizza Crust](https://www.allrecipes.com/recipe/223042/cauliflower-pizza-crust/) by Alli Shircliff\n\n### ✅ Meets All Criteria:\n| Criterion | Requirement | Recipe Value |\n|-----------|-------------|--------------|\n| ⭐ **Rating** | At least 4 stars | **4.2 out of 5 stars** (295 ratings) |\n| ⏱️ **Prep Time** | Under 30 minutes | **15 minutes** |\n| 🔥 **Calories per serving** | (Requested) | **59 calories** |\n\n### 📋 Additional Details:\n- **Cook Time:** 30 mins\n- **Additional Time:** 15 mins\n- **Total Time:** 1 hour\n- **Servings:** 6\n- **Fat:** 4g\n- **Carbs:** 3g\n- **Protein:** 4g\n\n### 🥘 Ingredients:\n- ½ head cauliflower, coarsely chopped\n- ½ cup shredded Italian cheese blend\n- ¼ cup chopped fresh parsley\n- 1 large egg\n- 1 teaspoon chopped garlic\n- Salt and ground black pepper to taste\n\n### 👨‍🍳 Quick Directions:\n1. Pulse cauliflower through food processor with grating blade until shredded.\n2. Steam cauliflower for ~15 minutes, then refrigerate until cooled (about 15 minutes).\n3. Preheat oven to 450°F (230°C); line a baking sheet with parchment paper.\n4. Mix cheese, parsley, egg, garlic, salt, pepper, and cauliflower until well combined.\n5. Press mixture onto prepared baking sheet into a pizza crust shape.\n6. Bake for ~15 minutes until lightly browned. Add toppings and serve!\n\nThis recipe is a great low-carb, grain-free alternative to traditional pizza crust, and with only 59 calories per serving, it's a healthy choice!",
